{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":0},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":20},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":31},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":40},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":53},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":54},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":66},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":81},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":82},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":92},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":94},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":99},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":100},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":102},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":107},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":108},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":110},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":119},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":122},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":131},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":134},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":142},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":146},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":148},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":153},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":154},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"StorageLive":155},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":102},"kind":{"Assign":[{"kind":{"Local":0},"ty":{"Deduplicated":26}},{"Aggregate":[{"Adt":[{"id":0,"generics":{"regions":[],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_refs":[]},"builtin":"Tuple"},null,null]},[]]}]},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":128},"kind":{"StorageLive":3},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":129},"kind":{"StorageLive":4},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":129},"kind":{"Assign":[{"kind":{"Local":4},"ty":{"Deduplicated":9}},{"Use":[{"Copy":{"kind":{"Projection":[{"kind":{"Projection":[{"kind":{"Local":1},"ty":{"Deduplicated":42}},"Deref"]},"ty":{"Deduplicated":3}},{"Field":[null,0]}]},"ty":{"Deduplicated":9}}},"Yes"]}]},"comments_before":["The basic algorithm is, for every byte:","  a = (a + byte) % MOD","  b = (b + a) % MOD","where MOD = 65521.","","For efficiency, we can defer the `% MOD` operations as long as neither a nor b overflows:","- Between calls to `write`, we ensure that a and b are always in range 0..MOD.","- We use 32-bit arithmetic in this function.","- Therefore, a and b must not increase by more than 2^32-MOD without performing a `% MOD`","  operation.","","According to Wikipedia, b is calculated as follows for non-incremental checksumming:","  b = n×D1 + (n−1)×D2 + (n−2)×D3 + ... + Dn + n*1 (mod 65521)","Where n is the number of bytes and Di is the i-th Byte. We need to change this to account","for the previous values of a and b, as well as treat every input Byte as being 255:","  b_inc = n×255 + (n-1)×255 + ... + 255 + n*65520","Or in other words:","  b_inc = n*65520 + n(n+1)/2*255","The max chunk size is thus the largest value of n so that b_inc <= 2^32-65521.","  2^32-65521 = n*65520 + n(n+1)/2*255","Plugging this into an equation solver since I can't math gives n = 5552.18..., so 5552.","","On top of the optimization outlined above, the algorithm can also be parallelized with a","bit more work:","","Note that b is a linear combination of a vector of input bytes (D1, ..., Dn).","","If we fix some value k<N and rewrite indices 1, ..., N as","","  1_1, 1_2, ..., 1_k, 2_1, ..., 2_k, ..., (N/k)_k,","","then we can express a and b in terms of sums of smaller sequences kb and ka:","","  ka(j) := D1_j + D2_j + ... + D(N/k)_j where j <= k","  kb(j) := (N/k)*D1_j + (N/k-1)*D2_j + ... + D(N/k)_j where j <= k",""," a = ka(1) + ka(2) + ... + ka(k) + 1"," b = k*(kb(1) + kb(2) + ... + kb(k)) - 1*ka(2) - ...  - (k-1)*ka(k) + N","","We use this insight to unroll the main loop and process k=4 bytes at a time.","The resulting code is highly amenable to SIMD acceleration, although the immediate speedups","stem from increased pipeline parallelism rather than auto-vectorization.","","This technique is described in-depth (here:)[https://software.intel.com/content/www/us/\\","en/develop/articles/fast-computation-of-fletcher-checksums.html]"]}],"terminator":{"span":{"Value":[238,{"data":{"file_id":5,"beg":{"line":55,"col":20},"end":{"line":55,"col":37}},"generated_from_span":null}]},"kind":{"Call":{"call":{"func":{"Regular":{"kind":{"Fun":7},"generics":{"regions":[],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_refs":[]}}},"args":[{"Move":{"kind":{"Local":4},"ty":{"Deduplicated":9}}}],"dest":{"kind":{"Local":3},"ty":{"Deduplicated":11}},"safety":"Inherit"},"target":2,"on_unwind":1}},"comments_before":[]},"is_cleanup":false},{"statements":[],"terminator":{"span":{"Deduplicated":238},"kind":"UndefinedBehavior","comments_before":[]},"is_cleanup":true},{"statements":[{"span":{"Value":[239,{"data":{"file_id":5,"beg":{"line":55,"col":36},"end":{"line":55,"col":37}},"generated_from_span":null}]},"kind":{"StorageDead":4},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":130},"kind":{"StorageLive":5},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":131},"kind":{"StorageLive":6},"comments_before":[]},{"span":{"Deduplicated":131},"kind":{"Assign":[{"kind":{"Local":6},"ty":{"Deduplicated":9}},{"Use":[{